+//    2. a delimiter adds a trailing empty item only when it is the very LAST char:
+//       "a,b," -> {a,b,""} but "a, " -> {a};  "a,,b" -> {a,"",b};
+//    3. text right after a closing quote starts the next item: "\"ab\"cd,e" -> {ab,cd,e};
